  "body": "Welcome to your dream home at Lot 13/20 Melia Place! \r\n\r\nNestled in the sought-after neighborhood of Stanmore Bay. This delightful 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom house is the perfect blend of comfort and style, offering a serene retreat for families and individuals alike.\r\n\r\n**Property Features:**\r\n* Bedrooms: 3 spacious bedrooms, designed for relaxation and comfort.\r\n* Bathrooms: 1 well-appointed bathroom, featuring modern fixtures and finishes and 1 separate toilet for added convenience.\r\n* The open-plan design seamlessly connects the living area to the dining room, perfect for entertaining friends and family.\r\n* Outdoor Oasis: The backyard is a true gem, offering a private outdoor space for relaxation and recreation. Whether you want to host a summer barbecue or simply unwind in nature, this yard provides the perfect setting. \r\n* The neighborhood is known for its friendly community vibe, and you'll love the convenience of nearby parks and recreational facilities.\r\n* Situated in the picturesque Stanmore Bay, you'll enjoy the benefits of coastal living while being just a short drive from local amenities, shops, and schools. This location is ideal for families, professionals, and anyone looking to embrace a vibrant lifestyle\r\n\r\nContact us NOW to arrange a viewing and see for yourself what makes 20 Melia Place the perfect place to call home!",
